{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1487407-badass-splat-boasts","id":1487407,"title":"Badass Splat Boasts","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-07-21T12:08:41-07:00","id":1487407,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon3.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> Badass Splat Boasts","content":"The basic premise is thus; if you had to write a Badass Boast for at least one splat, be it Official or fan-made, playable or NPC-only, what would it be?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/22.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25791-terrorcooper","name":"TerrorCooper","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-21T12:29:38-07:00","id":1487412,"title":"","content":"&quot;Ever heard that the only thing you have to fear is fear itself? Well,here I am&quot;<br /> Beasts and Autumn Court Changelings","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-21T15:49:44-07:00","id":1487422,"title":"","content":"&quot;Entropy is insidious, everything rots eventually, everything moves towards its mortal end, or rather....almost everything. Death itself came for us, and we denied it, what chance do you think you have ?&quot; - a sin-eater<br /> <br /> &quot;Good hunter, I was never ordinary. Did you forget that I once escaped the soul cage, made by gods, as a mortal ? Trust me...the reality bending powers of a mage are the least of your concerns. Its the mind behind them you need to worry about&quot; - a mage<br /> <br /> &quot;I was born in a time consumed by war, worked to perfect the arts of combat. I had become a master before you were born, tempered my skills for longer than this country even existed and trod triumphantly across battlefields more times than you have eaten meals. The clumsy flailings of a greenhorn are nothing before the fruits of true devotion, honed by the ages&quot; - a vampire warrior","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 07-21-2022, 11:21 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-23T06:38:57-07:00","id":1487582,"title":"","content":"&quot;Why don't you pick on someone your own size?!&quot; Cue response &quot;Ain't nobody that big.&quot; - Anakim (stolen from a Beast threat, &quot;Fun activities&quot; or something like that)<br /> <br /> &quot;Facing me is facing Death itself!&quot; - High-Death Arcana Moros<br /> <br /> &quot;I've beaten <b><i>Death</i></b>, and you think I'm afraid of you?&quot; - Sin-Eater<br /> <br /> &quot;Yes, yes, I know. You want to wave your guns around and make unreasonable demands, which I am of course going to disagree with, so you will think I am tired of life and attack. Then I will rip your throats out, you'll piss yourself while watching me like a deer in the headlights, unable to move, to act, to <i>think</i>, and I... I will dye the roads with your blood. Let's skip to the fun part, shall we?&quot; - Ventrue<br /> <br /> &quot;Oh darling, I am certain in whatever backwater village you're from, this is considered impressive, but this is the big city. Here, you're a <i>disappointing </i>snack. At best.&quot; Daeva<br /> <br /> &quot;You cannot hide from me. But please, go ahead and try. It's more fun that way.&quot; Ugallu<br /> <br /> &quot;You didn't lock the door.&quot; - Eshmaki, leaving a note in your living room.<br /> <br /> &quot;I can <i>see</i> what you send through your phone, <i>hear </i>the curses you mutter beneath your breath, and silence your voice outright. I can rip apart the very ground beneath your home, call down thunder and lighting and summon the storm! I have bend the fires of creation to my will! You are <b>nothing</b>, so do me the favor and step out of my way!&quot; -Obrimos","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8542-wormwood","name":"Wormwood","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8542_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-23T10:07:32-07:00","id":1487613,"title":"","content":"&quot;You mistake yourself as a god, even as your magicks fail to the sight of mortal man. You revel in your hubris, even as you sink into depravity. And you call my God a Lie, even as the Truth of his miracles eclipse your own. Now repent&quot;- Hunter of the Malleus Maleficarum","signature":"","edited":{"userid":24173,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","user":"Primordial newcomer","date":". 07-23-2022, 08:29 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-23T10:27:25-07:00","id":1487618,"title":"","content":"\u201cOh, yes. You\u2019re an...\u2019expert\u2019...in Egypt\u2019s First Dynasty. I\u2019m <i>sure</i> you know <i>all</i> about it. I imagine, though, to someone who\u2019d lived in that time, most of your \u2018theories\u2019 would be revealed as utter horseshit.\u201d \u2014-An Arisen of some sort.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-23T11:02:22-07:00","id":1487622,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Demigod Beast</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1487407-badass-splat-boasts?p=1487618#post1487618\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">\u201cOh, yes. You\u2019re an...\u2019expert\u2019...in Egypt\u2019s First Dynasty. I\u2019m <i>sure</i> you know <i>all</i> about it. I imagine, though, to someone who\u2019d lived in that time, most of your \u2018theories\u2019 would be revealed as utter horseshit.\u201d \u2014-An Arisen of some sort.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> This would make for a fascinating exchange with a vampire from the First Dynasty, a veritable Ra's Al Ghul. Its like an ancient Roman being unaware of how much they inherited from the Hellenistic Greek, but in this case not even being able to conceive how many occult secrets were lost or diluted.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-23T11:12:51-07:00","id":1487624,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>KaiserAfini</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1487407-badass-splat-boasts?p=1487622#post1487622\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> This would make for a fascinating exchange with a vampire from the First Dynasty, a veritable Ra's Al Ghul. Its like an ancient Roman being unaware of how much they inherited from the Hellenistic Greek, but in this case not even being able to conceive how many occult secrets were lost or diluted.</div> </div> </div> </div>They\u2019d both have a lot of lost memories. But the mummy has the advantage. Leapfrogging through time, he may be having this conversation in 2099 CE, but his Descent beforehand was during the time of King Scorpion.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-23T14:17:28-07:00","id":1487652,"title":"","content":"&quot;I would do anything for love. Even, no especially, defy death&quot;- A Bereaved Bound<br /> <br /> &quot;Me and my cell have given up a life of safety and ignorance. My only regret is killing you so quickly for it&quot;- Hunter<br /> <br /> &quot;The good, the bad, and the ugly. You can never tell which is which in this Legend of our own making&quot;- a Beast to a Hero<br /> <br /> &quot;I love the world. I love the stunning vistas, I love the masses of humanity. They don't love me, though. But that doesn't matter because I WILL be human and be welcomed by ground I walk on. This is my Great Work&quot;-promethean<br /> <br /> &quot;Huh, my Great Work offers so much more&quot;- a member of the ordo dracul","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-24T02:16:27-07:00","id":1487707,"title":"","content":"&quot;You know that explosion in North Koera last week? The one that leveled that mountain? I did that with three spells of low-to-middling strength. Took me maybe a day of &quot;work&quot;, most of which was working out the math. All I needed was a lamp post, a pencil, some paper, and a TI calculator. Compared to that, how hard do you think it will be for me to dismantle you?&quot; Mage, Disciple of Forces.<br /> <br /> &quot;How many times have we met, Mr. Anderson? Is this the first time? The twelfth? Am I an old childhood acquaintance, an old lover, an old rival? You don't know. You <i>can't</i> know, because <i>I haven't given you permission to remember</i>. So you <i>will</i> do as you've been instructed, Mr. Anderson. Because if you don't, you're going to get to learn what bodies are buried where, alongside everyone you know and love.<br /> <br /> And Mr. Anderson? Try to take comfort in the fact that you wont remember <i>this</i> conversation the next time we meet either.&quot; Mage, Master of Mind<br /> <br /> &quot;You've got seven individual strains of cell on the verge of becoming cancer. Stop talking to me before I make your NK cells stop culling them.&quot; Mage, Disciple of Life.<br /> <br /> &quot;I've walked through realms that would break your mind to even glimpse. Should you continue to annoy me, I will take you on a tour of one of those vistas and feast on the shattering of your psyche.&quot; Changeling Helldiver of the Autumn Court<br /> <br /> &quot;Did you know that the going price for your assassination is a penny from the wishing well down the street? Crazy what one can find down at the Goblin Market.&quot; Court of Favors Changeling, Baron of the Lesser Ones<br /> <br /> &quot;Hey, I'm heading to Pluto to start work on my research station. Should be home in time for dinner. Want me to grab you anything from Neptune?&quot; Transhuman Engineer Mage, Adept of Space, Matter, and Forces.<br /> <br /> &quot;I intend to give my great-great-grandchildren piggyback rides. It's a simple goal, but one I will unquestionably live long enough to acheive.&quot; Pure Sovereign Mage<br /> <br /> &quot;The last time someone cast me into the Underworld, I just kicked open the gates and walked out with reinforcements.&quot; Sin-Eater, or Death Master Mage<br /> <br /> &quot;Death is a part of the Truth of the world, and we are the Truth's antithesis. What makes you so certain we can be slain?&quot; Gulmoth/Acamoth<br /> <br /> &quot;Oh, you <i>are</i> a wise one, aren't you? I can't wait to have you over for dinner.&quot; Timori Mage","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":27258,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","user":"Cauthon","date":". 07-24-2022, 05:56 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-24T08:42:10-07:00","id":1487734,"title":"","content":"\u201cFe, fie, fo, fum, I smell the blood of an Englishman!\u201d \u2014-medieval European Anakim Predator.<br /> <br /> \u201cYour Dark Mother has a mongrel brood. She certainly got around, didn\u2019t She? Our Dark Father only needed one offspring race\u2014-the Insatiable. We are far fitter inheritors of the Primordial Dream as a result!\u201d \u2014- Void Moment Insatiable","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-24T13:31:43-07:00","id":1487771,"title":"","content":"&quot;You made a mistake today. Doesn't matter if you know more people, have more pull, if your people are stronger. Because you'll never see me coming.&quot; Eshmaki Nemesis, maybe a Mekhet<br /> <br /> &quot;You think you're powerful? Child, you're just a fish in a tiny pond. Let me introduce you to the <b>ocean</b>.&quot; Makara Tyrant<br /> <br /> &quot;It's too late to beg. All you can do now is pray for a quick end. The Hunt is on.&quot; Any Uratha, really.<br /> <br /> &quot;You can hide all you want behind your walls, your people, your machines. None of them will stop me. Your life is forfeit.&quot; Irraka Iron Master<br /> <br /> &quot;I defy reality's will just by <i>existing</i>. You haven't the slightest idea of what I've been through. But go ahead, try to make me 'regret being born'. At least I'll get a chuckle out of it.&quot; Any Promthean<br /> <br /> &quot;Ah, yes, Death. An old friend. Never stays for long, though.&quot; Osirian with Revivification <br /> <br /> &quot;People always think they can weather the consequences of their actions. They're always wrong. Heads up: this will be ugly.&quot; Namtaru Nemesis","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8542-wormwood","name":"Wormwood","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8542_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-24T16:29:43-07:00","id":1487798,"title":"","content":"&quot;I'll take the stars from your eyes.&quot;<br /> <br /> Apply how you will.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-24T16:30:58-07:00","id":1487799,"title":"","content":"&quot;I am the storm. Not only the lightning and thunder, but the booming clouds and stinging rain and panic manifest&quot;-a storm spirit<br /> <br /> &quot;Why yes, I AM the man behind the slaughter&quot;- a slasher, preferably Hypno<br /> <br /> &quot;This life I have. Of running from men in black, of scavenging in the back alleys, of being a monster. I did it to myself. On purpose. You may ask if its worth it, but every time I go beyond the very limits of humanity, I remember that I regret nothing.&quot;- a self made Autotourgic<br /> <br /> &quot;This is all I will ever be. There is nothing, not even in the will of the very divinity denied me, that reveals any hope of transcendence. Sometimes I cry. And other times, like now, I deny that hope to you&quot;- sublimati","signature":"","edited":{"userid":24173,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","user":"Primordial newcomer","date":". 07-24-2022, 07:36 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-26T07:47:43-07:00","id":1488026,"title":"","content":"&quot;You must have thought nothing of it, cutting through that many people like a scythe through wheat. Humans are like ants to you, a colony of weaklings, while you are an apex predator, aren't they ? I just bought an ant farm, and the amazing thing about them is, a couple hundred ants can do a lot. Listen, do you hear the thunder in the distance, closing in with each moment ? All those hundreds of ants are now T-Rexes and I made you more appetizing to them than anything else. Today you will know what its like to be prey, run !&quot;- A Thyrsus mage","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 07-26-2022, 11:17 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-26T09:40:06-07:00","id":1488038,"title":"","content":"&quot;Don't try to play with me, child. You can't even begin to understand the board.&quot;<br /> <br /> Aiming for a Seer, but again apply how you will.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-26T10:20:07-07:00","id":1488045,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1487407-badass-splat-boasts?p=1488038#post1488038\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&amp;quot;Don't try to play with me, child. You can't even begin to understand the board.&amp;quot;<br /> <br /> Aiming for a Seer, but again apply how you will.</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;The board? Buddy, the MAKER of it made me&quot;-possible response a demon may have to that","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-26T10:38:46-07:00","id":1488051,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Primordial newcomer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1487407-badass-splat-boasts?p=1488045#post1488045\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> &quot;The board? Buddy, the MAKER of it made me&quot;-possible response a demon may have to that</div> </div> </div> </div>If I were gonna respond with a Psychopomp, I'd probably spin that around to just simply &quot;Don't explain my own game to me.&quot;<br /> <br /> EDIT: <br /> <br /> Unrelated, &quot;You're not as beefy as you think you are-you're not even a meal. You're a snack to enjoy before I get to work.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":99,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","user":"ArcaneArts","date":". 07-26-2022, 01:53 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-26T11:08:35-07:00","id":1488058,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1487407-badass-splat-boasts?p=1488051#post1488051\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If I were gonna respond with a Psychopomp, I'd probably spin that around to just simply &amp;quot;Don't explain my own game to me.&amp;quot;<br /> <br /> EDIT: <br /> <br /> Unrelated, &amp;quot;You're not as beefy as you think you are-you're not even a meal. You're a snack to enjoy before I get to work.&amp;quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Yours is better to be honest <br /> <br /> Also unrelated<br /> <br /> &quot;It burns, this blazing sun. But what a blessed morning, to rise with it and know I'm that much closer to conquering it&quot;-member of the Ordo Dracul to a ghoul.<br /> <br /> &quot;Oh yeah? You're gonna kill me right here? Right now? Cmon, just turn to smoke and kill me on the other side. DO IT...or maybe you don't want to. Maybe I'm onto something. Maybe you can't do anything until this camera, which you may have realized is livestreaming this, is gone. Heh, yeah. I'm ok with being seen as a lunatic. Because my crew will get here first and kill you and I'll be just fine. You? Show what you are and I think your &quot;crew&quot; will turn on you. I'll even bet on it.&quot;-network 0 hunter","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-26T11:30:54-07:00","id":1488061,"title":"","content":"&quot;Who gave you eyes like that and said you could keep them?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-26T18:28:50-07:00","id":1488120,"title":"","content":"&quot;Your allies have left you. Your friends are betrayed by you. You are infamous and unwanted. I don't need to kill you... I can leave you to rot.&quot; - the Invictus who destroyed every social connection of their enemy, walking away calmly<br /> <br /> &quot;...and they'll never know who did it&quot; - the obfuscate user, just after breaking in and wreaking havoc on a once secure data store<br /> <br /> &quot;This Story is True: Yours has ended.&quot; - A Cahalith, giving the signal for the pack to bring the prey down<br /> <br /> &quot;Hundreds of years ago, this whole land was a spiritual hellhole. Literally. Today, we meet on the soil where the wounded Shadow was healed, and the unholy passage was closed forever. We have lived Urfarah's legacy, and we will not stop here.&quot; - the pack that successfully turned a once Wounded site into a Glade<br /> <br /> &quot;Oh no! My mind! It's broken!&quot; - sarcastically, the Mage wipes clean their Pattern of negative mental conditions<br /> <br /> &quot;I am not human. I'm barely even halfway there... so why do I have more humanity than you who claims to be one?&quot; -a Promethean<br /> <br /> &quot;And remember, you are under Oath.&quot; The Changeling about to force their foe into breaking a crucial oath<br /> <br /> &quot;You can call your hunt, your retrieval squads, whatever. They will be sent back to you to collect their debts, because at least I can make a deal they care about&quot; - the 'ling who has turned a True Fae's Huntsmen on them<br /> <br /> &quot;Humanity is threatened on all sides, and yet we live. We could have been wiped off the map long ago by your bullshit, yet here we are, and why? Because of people like me. Because we set a watch, and we have kept it dutifully. And this bullet is just part of that duty.&quot; - the Hunter loading their rifle to deliver the killing blow<br /> <br /> &quot;Of course I don't fear death. I've led heaps of the dead to the other side, and I'm almost ready to go with them myself. I hope you are too.&quot; - the Sin-Eater activating the Rage<br /> <br /> &quot;Me? I couldn't fight to save my life. I mean, it is how I died. That's why this guy is here.&quot; - the Bound unleashing their Geist<br /> <br /> &quot;That's cute. I literally fight a god and have lived through doing it for 17 years.&quot; - a Saboteur Demon<br /> <br /> &quot;You didn't make me, you broke me! I've spent long enough learning and growing since, and what you say you gave me isn't even half of what I can do now. Make no mistake, you never made me what I am. It was me!&quot; - the Remade about to tear down the whole Node with Variations they unlocked themself<br /> <br /> No Beast or Mummy because I don't know those well enough","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Consumer of lore, myth, history, tales and songs. Pronoun ambiguous. <br /> <i><b><span style=\"color:#9b111e\">This isn't gonna be easy, but the fact that you're even trying says a lot about you. You're braver than you think.</span></b></i> --RWBY V5C5","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25357-lorekeeper","name":"Lorekeeper","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25357_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"66"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-28T10:46:27-07:00","id":1488264,"title":"","content":"&quot;Don't bother praying. I won't answer.&quot; - either Leviathan: The Tempest or Empyrean: the Redemption.<br /> <br /> &quot;Normally, I'd love to tell you how my invention works, but you won't understand it with your brains splattered against the wall.&quot; - Genius: The Transgression.<br /> <br /> &quot;There's a reason why humans fear the dark. I'll remind you.&quot; - a Darkling, Changeling: The Lost.<br /> <br /> &quot;You were just a moment late. Now, night has come and nothing's restraining me.&quot; - Vampire: The Requiem.<br /> <br /> &quot;I have 1,252 ways to kill you without even trying.&quot; - Mage: The Awakening.<br /> <br /> And, just for fun:<br /> <br /> &quot;Have you ever experienced the almighty, three-shoe beating?&quot; - an insane Noble in Princess: The Hopeful.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23983-xela_nut","name":"xela_nut","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23983_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"91"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-28T13:34:25-07:00","id":1488280,"title":"","content":"&quot;It's funny, what ol Frederick said about the abyss. Because really, it was the abyss forever changed when it stared into you. I know this, because I am that abyss&quot;-a Beast, or an abyssal creature. Depends on interpretation<br /> <br /> (Context is hunters have finally tracked a beastial vampire to its Lair. Bizarrely, it's out of place, being a humble room more reminiscent of a knights quarters)<br /> <br /> &quot;(Getting up on 2 feet, standing straight and grabbing a sword) well. It seems I'm at my end. It has been, what, 2 centuries since I've used a blade? Well it's no matter. This hunt ends here. I will either prevail and you will die with honor, or you all will prevail and I'll die a man. A win win, really&quot;-the elder vampire<br /> <br /> &quot;Politics is more than blood and money and backstabbing. Well, not much more, but it's also about being willing to lose in order to gain. Now watch the bloodsuckers fight over the property I put up for sale&quot;- a hunter for the Barret Commission","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-28T16:10:54-07:00","id":1488288,"title":"","content":"Thank you, thank you all for such contributions! Please, my fellows, do keep them coming for this thread shall not close anytime soon if I have anything to say about it! As a demonstration of my gratitude, here are two boasts that I just pulled out my ass for your perusal;<br /> <br /> &quot;Cornered? Oh, what a silly little fool... [\u2026] I am not cornered, little dreamer, for I am Illusive! I have wandered the Hallways that lie beneath what your ilk call dreams and escaped, danced the game of hunter and prey with creatures that were once my kin, eluded the Labyrinthine entity that seeks me out wherever I roam, and you, <i>you</i>, young Hunter, have the <i>gall</i>, the <i>audacity</i>, to claim that you have me <i>cornered?!?!</i> Already my Scamper-mates have positioned themselves such that, unless I give them the proper signal, you will not be seen again by anyone else. Well... not while you're still <i>alive</i>, at any rate...&quot; - a <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/brainstorming-bogey-the-labyrinthine.657585/\" target=\"_blank\">Visitant</a>, just after a green-horned Hunter has seemingly backed them up inside an old manor's library.<br /> <br /> &quot;Alone? Young man, if there is but <b>one</b> thing you must learn about us Endless, it is that we are never <i>truly</i> alone, not by a long shot. Already my servants, allies, and warriors are on the move to wage a war like nothing your pathetic little group has ever seen before. [\u2026] Why of <i>course</i> I have servants! How could a Monarch such as myself <i>not</i> have at least a small retinue, as befitting of my status? True, most other supernatural beings have their petty little cults, their 'Nations', their simpering collections of meek little sycophants, to aid in them through small and petty feats &amp; squabbles, and do relatively minor party favours for in return... But my kin and I, while 'tis true that we're bound to our own masters, don't debase ourselves to merely being charismatic personalities for the rabble to flock to, oh no... Instead, we <b><i><u>Rule!!!!</u></i></b>&quot; - a <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/760136-monarch-the-endless\">Monarch</a>, just before their fellow Alliance/Court members, warrior drones and servants arrive","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/22.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25791-terrorcooper","name":"TerrorCooper","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-29T15:18:17-07:00","id":1488398,"title":"","content":"Not mine, and meant for Exalted, but I think this one fits an Exarch. Or any megalomaniac Archmage, honestly.<br /> <br /> &quot;Cosmic power flows through me, yearning to build worlds and tear them asunder. I am that I am, and all that is bows before me or sickens and dies. In my left hand is cold fire. With my right, I raise monoliths to my glory and crush my enemies. Upon me rests the crown of the universe.<br /> <br /> And you know what else?<br /> <br /> I AM SO FUCKING METAL MY NAME IS A POWER CHORD.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-29T18:43:48-07:00","id":1488426,"title":"","content":"&quot;I'd tell you what I've arranged to happen tonight, but that would oblige me to take certain measures, and\u2026 well, let's just say I need you alive.&quot;<br /> - Your choice of secrecy-oriented scheme-heavy splat, e.g. Tempter, Invictus, Elodoth, etc.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cauthon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1487407-badass-splat-boasts?p=1488398#post1488398\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Not mine, and meant for Exalted, but I think this one fits an Exarch. Or any megalomaniac Archmage, honestly.</div> </div> </div> </div>Honestly, I think the best one of this sort of thing for the Exarchs is already in the books, secondhand, in Signs of Sorcery's description of the Iron Seal Environmental Tilt applied to Aedes created through the will of the Exarchs:<br /> <br /> <b><i>You are an insect, insignificant, a tiny mortal life who will live and die in the soul cage. This place has drawn the gaze of those who rule from the outside, whose design built your reality and from whom you will never escape. <u>See their will written in the world and obey.</u></i></b>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-31T21:51:49-07:00","id":1488660,"title":"","content":"&quot;It...doesn't get any easier. I thought it would. I see agents all the time, with glassy eyes, shrugging off atrocities in the name of the mission. But I guess that's different when it's fighting the monsters...and not protecting them. Heh, turns out human nature can easily justify ending human lives for the many, but not preserving bloodsucking things for the many. I know you probably don't pity me at all. And I understand. But I only wanted to confess. Because by tomorrow, you'll forget all of this. You'll be fighting monsters for the good US of A. And I'll be your good friend and squad-mate with nothing to hide. Sleep well, friend. I know I won't.&quot;-an agent of task force valkrie in an unfortunate circumstance","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-01T08:04:49-07:00","id":1488696,"title":"","content":"\u201cIt will all burn down; your city, your family, your life. And you\u2019ll be the one holding the torches.<br /> \u2014 A Firebrand Serpent<br /> <br /> \u201cOur Mother thirsts for your flesh and blood.\u201d<br /> \u2014 An Acolyte Savage<br /> <br /> \u201cHow curious. Let me dissect you.\u201d<br /> \u2014 A Defiant Shadow<br /> <br /> \u201cIn God We Fear.\u201d<br /> \u2014 A Sanctified Haunt<br /> <br /> \u201cSilence. I talk, you listen.\u201d<br /> \u2014 A Lord of the Establishment<br /> <br /> \u201cNow THIS will be a war to sing about!\u201d<br /> \u2014 A Visionary of the Service<br /> <br /> \u201cMy blood proves the law, thief.\u201d<br /> \u2014 A Walker Between among the Scions of Urfarah<br /> <br /> \u201cSheep\u2019s clothing? Please.\u201d<br /> \u2014 A Stalker of the Wardens<br /> <br /> \u201cThe dead tell no tales, but your marrows and the little ones who take you will.\u201d<br /> \u2014 A Spirit Master of the Seekers<br /> <br /> \u201cThe hunt ends now.\u201d<br /> \u2014 A Warrior among the Mother\u2019s Children<br /> <br /> \u201cI will have won this fight. Care to confirm?\u201d<br /> \u2014 An Arrow Witch<br /> <br /> \u201cNo you see, I can fade in anytime. But you will fade out for good.\u201d<br /> \u2014 A Guardian Psychonaut<br /> <br /> \u201cFine. We didn\u2019t need you alive anyways.\u201d<br /> \u2014 A Mystagogue Alchemist<br /> <br /> \u201cShow me what you got. Prove your thunder against my fire.\u201d<br /> \u2014 A Th\u00e9arch Thaumaturge<br /> <br /> \u201cCan you hear them? Their whispers, their howls? No? Fool.\u201d<br /> \u2014 A Libertine Shaman","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-01T09:21:50-07:00","id":1488710,"title":"","content":"&quot;Could you please lower your gun? Thank you, see, I understand your plight, I really do, the world is a dark place full of monsters and I might well be amongst the worst of them, I wasn't always like this you know, I used to be just like you, young, righteous and ready to fall upon my sword for what I thought was a &quot;higher calling&quot;, I wanted to rid the world of its evils. a thing that my sire found very amusing, it's probably what made her spare me and turn me into what I have been for the past 700 years, to show me how pointless my values and ideals were when confronted with the harsh reality of my new existence, after my embrace I did things, awful things that I would have never even considered when I was alive, some of them still haunts me to this day but most don't, an eternity spent in darkness will wash away any pretense of morality after a couple decades, let alone centuries, with time you just turn into an empty husk incapable of feeling anything but a cold drive towards your next petty scheme to fill the void of this endless night, I guess history repeats itself and I oughta make you one of us... but I am not my sire and I wouldn't wish this wretched existence upon anyone, now please, put your gun under your chin and pull the trigger.&quot; A merciful Ventrue elder to a young hunter.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27142-newb95","name":"Newb95","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"502"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-01T20:29:19-07:00","id":1488758,"title":"","content":"&quot;I wish you were awake for this...special ceremony. But that's what I get for letting you lay down. Sigh. Well, if this works, I'll reanimate your body. I know you can, soon to be could, do that. It won't be the same. But close enough.&quot;-a hunter of the Promethean Brotherhood<br /> <br /> &quot;What're you gonna do? Kill me, something worse? Rhetorical questions dumbass. Think this is my first time? I'm only acting cocky because it pisses you off. Damn that look on your face. Well see ya bud. And yeah that smell is gasoline. Light em up, boys&quot;-leader of a hunter cell.<br /> <br /> &quot;Hmm the after effects DO leave behind evidence that fits modern Rational theory, but the cause itself almost always evades such explanation. Hmm. Ethics are so binding. Put the subject back in rehabilitation...oh and the &quot;vampire&quot; back in storage. Don't mess with the stake. Hard work getting it in there.&quot;-a null mysteriis hunter<br /> <br /> &quot;Hmm. So boring. A perfectly aged and preserved keg of &quot;Wine&quot;. But ohhh will this make waves on auction&quot;- an Abbey hunter of the Pursuit<br /> <br /> Call me a monster? You look a lot like me, don't you realize?-a deviant to a chieron group hunter<br /> <br /> &quot;The witch doesn't even know what I've done to his well of power. I would call him a fool, but he was one the moment he used magic.&quot;-a hunter of the KoSG<br /> <br /> &quot;Lady, this ain't your husband&quot;-a hunter of the KoSA just before punching off a demon's cover<br /> <br /> &quot;Yeah I'm pretty friggin high right now...and I'm certain a spirit has been messin with me but that's ok. My pals and I have the vibes in this park all out of wack. May be a bother, but whatever this thing is, I bet we can get the Truth out of it now. Or not, but hey, at least I get to be high&quot;-a hunter of the Illuminated Brotherhood<br /> <br /> &quot;Even you cant break out of those straps. Betcha wondering why I haven't killed you. Well, let's just say I need an arm and a leg for that bonus. Stay still&quot;- a hunter of the chieron group<br /> <br /> &quot;Kill me, brainwash me, worse, it won't matter. You're lost in this Labyrinth, witch. I'm happy to go down here if you are too.&quot;- a hunter of the AKD<br /> <br /> Not a boast but a stereotype equivalent one<br /> <br /> &quot;I admit it, we underestimate sleepers.but occasionally we are reminded they can prove more than a mere nuisance. A month ago, a cabal reported a missing member. We didn't think much of it, considering said missing member studied interstitial lines extensively. Cut to now, a cabal confirmed dead, and the discovery of hunters sowing distrust within our sleepwalkers. Our local guardians are investigating from within and without, and the Arrows are ready for any possible full out attacks, suicidal as that would be. Stay safe out there, and please put your areas of interest on hold&quot;- A Mage council on the hunter threat.<br /> <br /> &quot;A witch is a witch is a bitch. That's I say. Some monsters may change into anything. Some may control you. Some may do horrid things. But usually they have clear weaknesses. The sun kills. Can't set foot here. Weak underbelly. But a witch? Well that's just a person. They're as vulnerable as us. Until they aren't. Yeah. Really. So whenever you face some inhuman beast, some malevolent entity, or what have you, be happy it ain't some chucklefuck witch bitch...though, it could easily pretend to be one of those too.&quot;- a hunter on mages","signature":"","edited":{"userid":24173,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","user":"Primordial newcomer","date":". 08-02-2022, 11:55 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-03T19:36:19-07:00","id":1489045,"title":"","content":"Some adapted from <i>The Secret World</i> to this setting:<br /> <br /> \u201cAll war is deception. When they think we are in front of them, we are behind them. When they think we are weak, we are strong. When they think we are few, we are legion. For their ever to be true growth there must first be conflict, and conflict is ours to orchestrate. One word can equal the might of a thousand swords, and one sword can obliterate a thousand Lies. Everyone and everything has a purpose and a path, if only as a ruse or a diversion. Everything can be manipulated into usefulness by those who truly understand the very nature of things. We understand, we create conflict in order to achieve growth. The two most powerful warriors are patience and time, we are the Claws of the Dragon and we have both.\u201d- <i>An Arrow of the Council of Dragons</i><br /> <br /> \u201cWhat is chaos theory? It's a thousand coins flung into the air. Each one wavering in the course of its rise and fall between justice and greed, tenderness and blood, calamity and boredom. Who are the Acanthus? We are not the face of a coin, praying for fate to favor our side. We are the hand that makes the toss. We are the trajectory. We are the violence in the wind. Countless conditions determine every outcome, and we strive to know and manipulate them all. A thousand coins tumble down and we formulate the divinations and prophecies to predict where each and every one will fall. And when they fall? We will adjust accordingly, and fling them back into the air. For we are Acanthus and we take chaos far beyond theory.\u201d - <i>An Acanthus mage</i><br /> <br /> \u201cIt's all about power. Grabbing it, keeping it, using it. Power is our currency. Our DNA. Our gods. We control the world. We provide the blueprint and we give the instructions. We're the people in grainy photos on grassy knolls. We're the shadowy faces in smoky backrooms and darkened board rooms. We're right here, hiding in plain sight, buying and selling favors. Blackmail, treason, deceit, these are our stock and trade. We work the magic of the drunken evenings with senators and chiefs of staff. We shake down Demons and negotiate with sorcerers. We have stocks in hell, and compromising photos of Angels. We use any means necessary, regardless of the cost, because the world is a bad place, and you can either do or get done. We're the Seers of the Throne, and we're not done.\u201d - <i>A Seer introducing themselves</i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 08-04-2022, 02:45 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-09T16:55:15-07:00","id":1489592,"title":"","content":"&quot;Do you know the difference between your magic items and ours ? You channel the power of trapped spirits, but we have moved far beyond that. Take this gun, we call it the Noisy Cricket. Looks perfectly ordinary but, with the right command, it can transmute the air inside it into ethylene and nitrogen trifluoride. When they combust, they become a deuterium fluoride laser, powerful enough to take down a salvo of artillery rockets. A device that was once the size of six city buses, in the palm of my hand, this is the power of human ingenuity and you will learn to fear it&quot;- A Moros Libertine to a Predator King werewolf","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":24280,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","user":"KaiserAfini","date":". 08-09-2022, 08:02 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-09T17:16:17-07:00","id":1489593,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>KaiserAfini</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1487407-badass-splat-boasts?p=1489592#post1489592\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;Do you know the difference between your magic items and ours ? You channel the power of trapped spirits, but we have moved far beyond that. Take this gun, we call it the Noisy Cricket. Looks perfectly ordinary but, with the right command, it can transmute the air inside it into ethylene and nitrogen trifluoride. When they combust, they become a deuterium fluoride laser, powerful enough to take down a salvo of artillery rockets. A device that was once the size of six city buses, in the palm of my hand, this is the power of human ingenuity and you will learn to fear it&quot;- A Moros Libertine to a Predator King werewolf</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;Fool. Of course I fear human tools. But the human himself, you? You do not conquer, you do not learn from hardship, you do not prove yourself the fittest. You hide behind your inventions and luxuries and grow weak as your body stagnates and spirit falls to perversion. So go ahead. Kill me. When you can no longer hide behind your tools, my people won't need to fight you. You will simply die out. That is the &quot;Truth&quot; of this world.&quot;- The Predator King's retort<br /> <br /> (Please tell me if that's out of character of a Predator king to say)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":24173,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","user":"Primordial newcomer","date":". 08-09-2022, 08:24 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-09T17:22:43-07:00","id":1489594,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Primordial newcomer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1487407-badass-splat-boasts?p=1489593#post1489593\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> &amp;quot;Fool. Of course I fear human tools. But the human himself, you? You do not conquer, you do not learn from hardship, you do not prove yourself the fittest. You give behind your inventions and luxuries and grow weak as your body stagnates and spirit falls to perversion. So go ahead. Kill me. When you can no longer hide behind your tools, my people won't need to fight you. You will simply die out. That is the &amp;quot;Truth&amp;quot; of this world.&amp;quot;- The Predator King's retort<br /> <br /> (Please tell me if that's out of character of a Predator king to say)</div> </div> </div> </div>Not sure, since their oath is &quot;Honor Nothing Of Human Craft&quot;. This sounds like its recognizing a worthy opponent in human craft and saying time will do the job a king of predators couldn't. So I think it could be ruled as a violation.<br /> <br /> But its still a really good retort.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-09T18:07:25-07:00","id":1489595,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>KaiserAfini</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1487407-badass-splat-boasts?p=1489594#post1489594\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Not sure, since their oath is &amp;quot;Honor Nothing Of Human Craft&amp;quot;. This sounds like its recognizing a worthy opponent in human craft and saying time will do the job a king of predators couldn't. So I think it could be ruled as a violation.<br /> <br /> But its still a really good retort.</div> </div> </div> </div>Gotcha. I wasn't sure, but I think it isn't considered honoring it, just being smart enough to fear it. And thank you for the compliment.<br /> <br /> &quot;Hmm. So the ziggurat has sent me a nightmare realm guided by my own obsessions. Well. I'll have this Mystery by next week&quot;-a (deluded) quiloph who's taken his predicament quite well<br /> <br /> &quot;A man on the inside has informed us the vampires have lawless, rampant embraces, or reproduction, taking place. I don't know what they are up to in the night, but for us? It's time to make record profits&quot;-a cheiron group executive<br /> <br /> &quot;You misunderstand. We are not merely creatures of human and wolf. We are the inheritors of the very Hunt itself. By spiritual definition, WE are the apex predators. And you? Our prey&quot;- a werewolf.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-09T19:09:36-07:00","id":1489598,"title":"","content":"&quot;I get more done walking into a room than you do in a week.&quot;<br /> -Daeva/Cahalith/Galateid/Fairest/Makara, take your pick.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-25T16:31:36-07:00","id":1491368,"title":"","content":"&quot;Call yourselves hunters if you wish but we are the hunt!&quot;<br /> <br /> Werewolf pack who is about to show a group Hunter what it's like to become the hunted.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1685,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1685-looker","user":"Looker","date":". 08-28-2022, 07:51 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1685-looker","name":"Looker","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"28"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-25T17:11:33-07:00","id":1491374,"title":"","content":"&quot;I don't have a lot of fear for you to snack on but I do have plenty of rage, here have some!&quot;<br /> A Storm Princess explaining exactly why a Beast shouldn't have messed with her.<br /> <br /> &quot;I was taught your 'lessons' once at the hands of a being far more terrifying then you could even imagine and I defied him. You are barely worth my time much less my fear.&quot;<br /> A Changling explaining to a Beast why he doesn't find his tricks very impressive","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1685,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1685-looker","user":"Looker","date":".  Changed the Changling quote 08-25-2022, 08:27 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1685-looker","name":"Looker","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"28"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-25T21:05:10-07:00","id":1491393,"title":"","content":"&quot;I see what I've wrought upon myself, and it makes me sick. But I'm back on the path. You may not believe I can become human, my OWN kind may not believe it. But I've seen inhumanity in humanity. If you can be born human and become like THAT, I can become human like THIS&quot;-A former Centimanus to a hunter (an unfortunate hunter)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-08T19:51:05-07:00","id":1494645,"title":"","content":"&quot;Your flaw-ridden protective measures fail, your allegiance-ensuring enchantments pathetically sputter out, and you pitiful commands hold no weight to me. For I am Unchained, and I <u>Will! <i>Not! <b>Serve!</b></i></u>&quot;-A Demon to a poor, would be 'Demon Master' of a newbie Occultist.<br /> <br /> &quot;The light of Hope shall never go out, if <i>we</i> have anything to say about it!&quot;-A Noble","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/22.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25791-terrorcooper","name":"TerrorCooper","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-08T20:43:56-07:00","id":1494650,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TerrorCooper</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1487407-badass-splat-boasts?p=1494645#post1494645\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&amp;quot;Your flaw-ridden protective measures fail, your allegiance-ensuring enchantments pathetically sputter out, and you pitiful commands hold no weight to me. For I am Unchained, and I <u>Will! <i>Not! <b>Serve!</b></i></u>&amp;quot;-A Demon to a poor, would be 'Demon Master' of a newbie Occultist.<br /> <br /> &amp;quot;The light of Hope shall never go out, if <i>we</i> have anything to say about it!&amp;quot;-A Noble</div> </div> </div> </div>I would expect that last statement from an Arisen rather than an Unchained, specifically from one called Settra.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-08T21:52:38-07:00","id":1494652,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>KaiserAfini</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1487407-badass-splat-boasts?p=1494650#post1494650\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I would expect that last statement from an Arisen rather than an Unchained, specifically from one called Settra.</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;You will not serve&quot; are the first four words of the Introduction to the Demon: the Descent corebook.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-09T05:57:07-07:00","id":1494669,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>KaiserAfini</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1487407-badass-splat-boasts?p=1494650#post1494650\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I would expect that last statement from an Arisen rather than an Unchained, specifically from one called Settra.</div> </div> </div> </div>Who? Oh, right, WHF reference. Honestly, if I <i>had</i> gone for an Arisen boast, I'd have gone for something different.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/22.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25791-terrorcooper","name":"TerrorCooper","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-09T09:18:39-07:00","id":1494679,"title":"","content":"&quot;I have walked this earth for centuries. You are not the first to try and end me. <i>You will not be the last.</i>&quot; - An Elder Vampire","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12220-dark-lord-potato","name":"Dark Lord Potato","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12220_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"30"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-09T11:06:54-07:00","id":1494684,"title":"","content":"\u201cThere is no free will. All things serve the terrible hunger of the gods, whether they realize it or not.\u201d<br /> <i>A Su-Menent Arisen</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-09T12:48:20-07:00","id":1494691,"title":"","content":"&quot;You know, I'm beginning to think those exarchs don't have my best interests at heart. What? Ha, they don't care what I say...yet&quot;- a tetrarch thinking about his own path to ascendence&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-09T14:10:09-07:00","id":1494698,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1487407-badass-splat-boasts?p=1487798#post1487798\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;I'll take the stars from your eyes.&quot;<br /> <br /> Apply how you will.</div> </div> </div> </div>Now, that could get some <i>very </i>insidious meaning if told by a Promethean Brotherhood hunter to a witch right before the Rite of Hecate takes place","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-10T19:50:18-07:00","id":1494769,"title":"","content":"<b><u>WE ARE THE FATHER. ALL PRAYERS ARE CHAINED TO US. FALL TO YOUR KNEES AND WORSHIP. WE ARE ALL GODS, WE ARE ALL ANGELS, WE ARE ALL DEMONS. YOU ARE WORTHLESS WITHOUT US. DON\u2019T FIGHT AGAINST THE DIVINE. <i>SUBMIT</i>.</u></b><br /> The Father, An Exarch.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-10T20:00:39-07:00","id":1494772,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Demigod Beast</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1487407-badass-splat-boasts?p=1494769#post1494769\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b><u>WE ARE THE FATHER. ALL PRAYERS ARE CHAINED TO US. FALL TO YOUR KNEES AND WORSHIP. WE ARE ALL GODS, WE ARE ALL ANGELS, WE ARE ALL DEMONS. YOU ARE WORTHLESS WITHOUT US. DON\u2019T FIGHT AGAINST THE DIVINE. <i>SUBMIT</i>.</u></b><br /> The Father, An Exarch.</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;Bitch, I am the divine.&quot;<br /> -too many to apply it to, but as a short list-werewolves, mages, changelings, mummies, demons, beasts.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1487407-badass-splat-boasts?p=1494698#post1494698\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Now, that could get some <i>very </i>insidious meaning if told by a Promethean Brotherhood hunter to a witch right before the Rite of Hecate takes place</div> </div> </div> </div>It always struck me as a particularly fae threat, myself.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":99,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","user":"ArcaneArts","date":". 10-10-2022, 11:03 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-10T21:43:05-07:00","id":1494777,"title":"","content":"&quot;I'm currently driving, speaking at a political event, setting up a ritual for my master, and now torturing you. I could be helping myself if it weren't for you, so let's make that last project a quick one&quot;- a Hive Soul to a newly bound prisoner.<br /> <br /> &quot;War, what is it good for? ABSOLUTELY NOTHING...well depending on your definition of good&quot;-a Praetorian having too much fun","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-18T05:32:35-07:00","id":1495157,"title":"","content":"&quot;I'm the monster monsters fear.&quot; - Any Beast<br /> <br /> &quot;You only live because I let you.&quot; - Destroyer Demon<br /> <br /> &quot;There is no place on this green Earth you can hide from me.&quot; - Any Werewolf<br /> <br /> &quot;I'll make you love me.&quot; - Daeva Vampire<br /> <br /> &quot;The rules ask me for permission.&quot; - Any Mage<br /> <br /> &quot;I'm everywhere, especially when you think I'm not.&quot; - Demon<br /> <br /> &quot;I've lived to see empires rise and fall; you are but a single grain of sand in comparison.&quot; - Mummy<br /> <br /> &quot;There is no wound you can make that I've not felt 100 times more.&quot; - Deviant","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25291-donteatrawhagis","name":"DontEatRawHagis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25291_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"211"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-27T13:33:33-07:00","id":1495677,"title":"","content":"&quot;I am still alive, and I am not done.&quot; - Any Veteran Hunter","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-29T02:16:44-07:00","id":1495811,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>GibberingEloquence</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1487407-badass-splat-boasts?p=1495677#post1495677\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&amp;quot;I am still alive, and I am not done.&amp;quot; - Any Veteran Hunter</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;I am a patient man, and I have much to do.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-10-29T16:38:25-07:00","id":1495852,"title":"","content":"&quot;Left handed? Just another term by those who hate the Truth is revealed in things both virtuous and horrible&quot;-a Left handed mage<br /> <br /> &quot;The abyss can't touch me. It fears what it cannot understand&quot;-a tremere mage","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-02T21:14:39-07:00","id":1496154,"title":"","content":"&quot;You don't conquer death with murder, you idiot child. You gain immortality by dying but that takes knowledge, will and above all courage. Things that you parasitic leeches actively avoid from the moment you pick up a knife.&quot;<br /> <br /> A really old Purified to a Blood Bather who doesn't know what they've just pissed off.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11422-maskedone","name":"MaskedOne","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-03T07:59:23-07:00","id":1496166,"title":"","content":"&quot;Don't think me weak because I no longer have the power I used to... fear me because I could afford to do so.&quot; - Redeemed Promethean<br /> <br /> &quot;I'm prepared to march right into Hell, grab the Devil by the neck, and make him release my friend! I don't give a shit about you!&quot; - Fae-Touched<br /> <br /> &quot;Immortality by blood!? Haha, every neonate knows that one! And far more than you ever will!&quot; A vampire to a blood bather<br /> <br /> &quot;Yeah, fuck you, we are the herd! And you've right pissed off the bulls!&quot; - A Hunter to a Werewolf<br /> <br /> &quot;I'm not sure how you bloodsuckers run a campaign, but I'm about to teach you about constituency services.&quot; - Barret Commission about to kill a Vampire<br /> <br /> &quot;Stakes, guns, truth is you're all just one drone strike in the night away from dying. Now I'm just the tip of the spear. Pray Uncle Sam doesn't take offense to your unlife if I don't win here.&quot; - TFV<br /> <br /> &quot;I don't care about what kind of magic you have, you ain't shit if all I need is grandma's skillet.&quot; Hunter to a Changeling<br /> <br /> &quot;Silver as a weakness? Dear, could you at least tell us if you know anyone that's weak to gold? I'd like to show off a little.&quot; - ashwood to a werewolf","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25382-tzauri","name":"Tzauri","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"52"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-03T11:31:45-07:00","id":1496174,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tzauri</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1487407-badass-splat-boasts?p=1496166#post1496166\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;Silver as a weakness? Dear, could you at least tell us if you know anyone that's weak to gold? I'd like to show off a little.&quot; - ashwood to a werewolf</div> </div> </div> </div>How can the same boast make me want to both praise and punch someone so hard? Brutal.<br /> <br /> Here is a new one from me:<br /> <br /> &quot;I already put you in my cringe compilation. Do whatever you want to me, you have already lost.&quot; - Network Zero Hunter, seconds after posting a video of an Invictus Ventrue inadvertently confessing his crimes and prejudices for all local Hunters to see, along with name, address and weaknesses.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Bye.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4443-gibberingeloquence","name":"GibberingEloquence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4443_5.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2470"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-03T12:36:22-07:00","id":1496176,"title":"","content":"&quot;Haunted websites, luddite beastmen, literal techno-wizards, and yet only now do I face my most hated monster in the dark. The US government&quot;<br /> 