":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7593-teatime","name":"Teatime","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7593_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"750"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-08T19:07:13-08:00","id":1496571,"title":"","content":"&quot;Dear, if only to save you from unnecessary effort let me regale you with the ways I've &quot;died&quot;; poison, drowning, decapitation, always the classic, electrocution, being burned at the stake, rather irritating actually, oh and one time I walked through a newly irradiated Chernobyl. I rather liked the peace and quiet then. And then there was being shot, blown up, set on fire AGAIN, and I suppose most recently a hit and run. And you're coming at me with a switchblade? Heh, be my guest.&quot; A Purified to a Harvester.<br /> <br /> &quot;Dude, you get what everyone else gets in this world. One lifetime.&quot; Harvester to a Purified. <br /> <br /> &quot;Oh I LOVE this part. This is when you tell me that you've feasted on the flesh of gods, have seen centuries pass in the blink of an eye, and know things that would make a man's brain leak from their ears and there is absolutely NOTHING an insect like me could do to you. Well here's what I have to say . . . You're fucked.&quot; Veteran Hunter. <br /> <br /> &quot;A devil's bargain huh? Yeah I know all about those.&quot; A Deviant to a Demon.<br /> <br /> &quot;Get out of my way.&quot; A high magnitude Deviant","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25493-mr-scissors","name":"Mr.Scissors","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"16"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-08T20:31:31-08:00","id":1496573,"title":"","content":"&quot;&quot;But this can't be&quot; you may be thinking, witch. But your visions and manipulations of Time revealed only what I made you see, and it seems even Fate, in the end, sided with me...<br /> <br /> Truth is, it was rigged from the start&quot;-a Warlock to a Witch<br /> <br /> &quot;Fuck...my head...oh boy...here I go killing again&quot;-an old Harrowed out to make the hurting stop.<br /> <br /> &quot;Hmm, whatever will I do&quot;-a Warlock put into an &quot;inescapable&quot; prison<br /> <br /> &quot;Like what you saw?&quot;-an Ashwood Abbey hunter, unphased by the utter violation of privacy done by a now sickened Warlock (won't lie, a friend of mine in a game actually came up with that line a week ago, stay tuned as he's still locked in a pocket space)<br /> <br /> &quot;Is the monologue over? I need a do over&quot;- a witch prepared to save scum before her death<br /> <br /> And my last two<br /> <br /> &quot;Wanna know how to kill a seer? Let his friends do the work&quot;- a libertine on how to kill the followers of the Lie<br /> <br /> &quot;He's absolutely right, what makes you think I got this promotion?&quot;- the twisted leader of the pylon spying on this libertine","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-09T12:14:21-08:00","id":1496621,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Primordial newcomer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1487407-badass-splat-boasts?p=1496573#post1496573\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;&quot;But this can't be&quot; you may be thinking, witch. But your visions and manipulations of Time revealed only what I made you see, and it seems even Fate, in the end, sided with me...<br /> <br /> Truth is, it was rigged from the start&quot;-a Warlock to a Witch</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;It's cute you think you did the rigging.&quot;-The Witch in response.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-09T12:27:41-08:00","id":1496623,"title":"","content":"\u201cMore? More will <i>never</i> be enough.\u201d<br /> An Insatiable of some sort.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-09T13:39:41-08:00","id":1496636,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Demigod Beast</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1487407-badass-splat-boasts?p=1494684#post1494684\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">\u201cThere is no free will. All things serve the terrible hunger of the gods, whether they realize it or not.\u201d<br /> <i>A Su-Menent Arisen</i></div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;i was created to kill gods.&quot; Any werewolf. but a mage might say &quot;i am here evn if the gods don't want to&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-09T13:44:41-08:00","id":1496638,"title":"","content":"oh,here's a remix of the idea. Quotes from our world re appropaited by the splats.<br /> <br /> &quot;How could you do me like that. I took ya family in<br /> I put some cash in ya pocket<br /> Made you a man again&quot;<br /> A Progenitor to a deviant seeking revenge&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Two headlights shine through the sleepless nighs and i will get you and get you alone&quot;<br /> A Beast stalking his prey<br /> <br /> &quot;We will NEVER surrender&quot;<br /> Libertines<br /> <br /> The quotes are originally by Churchil,Shakur and Swift","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-09T13:54:59-08:00","id":1496643,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1487407-badass-splat-boasts?p=1496636#post1496636\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&amp;quot;i was created to kill gods.&amp;quot; Any werewolf. but a mage might say &amp;quot;i am here evn if the gods don't want to&amp;quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>\u201cWith strange aeons even death may die.\u201d<br /> A Shuankhsen mummy.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-09T17:14:42-08:00","id":1496662,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1487407-badass-splat-boasts?p=1496621#post1496621\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&amp;quot;It's cute you think you did the rigging.&amp;quot;-The Witch in response.</div> </div> </div> </div>Nice, ans also, am I misunderstanding Time and Fate interactions with Mind? I always assumed Time mage sight wouldn't exactly reveal mastigos influence. Like if a mage looked into the future and wanted an apple, that mage could end up seeing herself getting an apple, only to learn it was all Mind illusion once it becomes the present.<br /> <br /> Back on track<br /> <br /> &quot;Dear Heirarch, I plead that you hold off the Arrow from interfering with the theriomorph pack. They're a Mystery I'm heavily invested in. I MADE their totem, after all...and I promise I have it under control&quot;- a Spirit Master <br /> <br /> &quot;Cmon now, my gods aren't so bad. I mean, they only command I protect humanity to rule them, but really they aren't that bad. And here's why. They didn't send me to kill you, that would be petty and needlessly cruel, and below them.<br /> <br /> It's not below me, though&quot;- a seer of the throne","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-09T17:59:45-08:00","id":1496663,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Primordial newcomer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1487407-badass-splat-boasts?p=1496662#post1496662\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Nice, ans also, am I misunderstanding Time and Fate interactions with Mind? I always assumed Time mage sight wouldn't exactly reveal mastigos influence. Like if a mage looked into the future and wanted an apple, that mage could end up seeing herself getting an apple, only to learn it was all Mind illusion once it becomes the present.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>That particular subject sounds like two spells clashing, but it's not the angle I was thinking-more my favorite Acanthus quote.<br /> <br /> &quot;What you call free will, I call a chain of accidents and their responses,&quot; says the casual deities of Plinko. The idea came from <i>somewhere</i>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":99,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","user":"ArcaneArts","date":". 11-09-2022, 09:16 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-09T18:06:26-08:00","id":1496664,"title":"","content":"\u201cLife began in the sea. Life will end in the sea. All else is interlude.\u201d<br /> A Bahamatan Leviathan.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-09T18:35:20-08:00","id":1496669,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1487407-badass-splat-boasts?p=1496663#post1496663\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That particular subject sounds like two spells clashing, but it's not the angle I was thinking-more my favorite Acanthus quote.<br /> <br /> &quot;What you call free will, I call a chain of accidents and their responses,&quot; says the casual deities of Plinko.</div> </div> </div> </div>Gotcha and thank you. Personally though, I prefer the mastigos stereotype to the acanthus, but I do love &quot;Lead turns to gold when it wishes it. If <br /> you knew how to ask, your Art could be reduced <br /> to simple questions&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Tyrannical gods, the world itself a Lie? Distant Cousin, do not deny all that is dark as some external force of evil. It is as natural as the light. And the limits you overcome every day mean nothing without it&quot;- a Beast to a mage","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-10T07:47:50-08:00","id":1496694,"title":"","content":"\u201cEven in this Hive, your suffering shall be legendary.\u201d<br /> An Inguma Enabler.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-11T09:36:55-08:00","id":1496818,"title":"","content":"So, Inguma Beasts:<br /> <br /> &quot;Oh, wondering why all your plans failed? It's quite simple actually, I knew all about your secret super deluxe brilliant plan to deal with me, after all it was me suggesting it all along, I mean, I have been your best friend for the past few months so obviously you would listen to what I had in mind&quot;<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24813-aeveth","name":"Aeveth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24813_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"86"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-11T16:03:07-08:00","id":1496863,"title":"","content":"All of these are lifted wholesale from my favorite book series.<br /> <br /> &quot;You can never know everything, and part of what you know is always wrong. Perhaps even the most important part. A portion of wisdom lies in knowing that. A portion of courage lies in going on anyways.&quot; - Archmage<br /> <br /> \u201cThe fact that the price must be paid is proof it is worth paying.\u201d - Immortals, Changelings, Left-Handed Mages, Prometheans.<br /> <br /> \u201cIt is easier to be brave when someone needs your protection.\u201d - Hunters, Ogres or Adamant Arrow <br /> <br /> \u201cI\u2019ve seen men die because they were sure that what should not happen, would not.\u201d - Veteran Hunters and Mages<br /> <br /> \u201cDuty is heavy as a mountain, death is light as a feather.\u201d - Adamant Arrow<br /> <br /> &quot;The Black Tower protects. Always.&quot; Arrow of the Black Tower faction<br /> <br /> \u201cBut men often mistake killing and revenge for justice. They seldom have the stomach for justice.\u201d - Bay City Marshal, Guardian of the Veil, or Sin-Eater<br /> <br /> \u201cIf you must mount the gallows, give a jest to the crowd, a coin the hangman, and make the drop with a smile on your lips.\u201d - Moros or Sin-Eater<br /> <br /> \u201cAlmost dead yesterday, maybe dead tomorrow, but alive, gloriously alive, today.\u201d - Sin-Eater or Promethean <br /> <br /> \u201cStories have power. Traveler's tales, and bards\u2019 epics, and rumors in the street alike. They stir passions, and change the way men see the world.\u201d - Changeling, Acanthus, or Astral/Shadow focused Mages<br /> <br /> \u201cA man who trusts everyone is a fool and a man who trusts no one is a fool. We are all fools if we live long enough.\u201d - Elder Changeling","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":27258,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","user":"Cauthon","date":". 11-12-2022, 04:36 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-11T16:08:35-08:00","id":1496864,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cauthon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1487407-badass-splat-boasts?p=1496863#post1496863\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">All of these are lifted wholesale from my favorite book series.<br /> <br /> &amp;quot;You can never know everything, and part of what you know is always wrong. Perhaps even the most important part. A portion of wisdom lies in knowing that. A portion of courage lies in going on anyways.&amp;quot; - Archmage<br /> <br /> \u201cThe fact that the price must be paid is proof it is worth paying.\u201d - Immortals, Changelings, Left-Handed Mages, Prometheans.<br /> <br /> \u201cIt was easier to be brave when someone needed your protection.\u201d - Hunters, Ogres or Adamant Arrow <br /> <br /> \u201cI\u2019ve seen men die because they were sure that what should not happen, would not.\u201d - Veteran Hunters and Mages<br /> <br /> \u201cDuty is heavy as a mountain, death is light as a feather.\u201d - Adamant Arrow<br /> <br /> &amp;quot;The Black Tower protects. Always.&amp;quot; Arrow of the Black Tower faction<br /> <br /> \u201cBut men often mistake killing and revenge for justice. They seldom have the stomach for justice.\u201d - Bay City Marshal, Guardian of the Veil, or Sin-Eater<br /> <br /> \u201cIf you must mount the gallows, give a jest to the crowd, a coin the hangman, and make the drop with a smile on your lips.\u201d - Moros or Sin-Eater<br /> <br /> \u201cAlmost dead yesterday, maybe dead tomorrow, but alive, gloriously alive, today.\u201d - Sin-Eater or Promethean <br /> <br /> \u201cStories have power. Traveler's tales, and bards\u2019 epics, and rumors in the street alike. They stir passions, and change the way men see the world.\u201d - Changeling, Acanthus, or Astral/Shadow focused Mages<br /> <br /> \u201cA man who trusts everyone is a fool and a man who trusts no one is a fool. We are all fools if we live long enough.\u201d - Elder Changeling</div> </div> </div> </div>That's the wheel of time by Robert Jordan?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-11T16:20:55-08:00","id":1496866,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1487407-badass-splat-boasts?p=1496864#post1496864\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That's the wheel of time by Robert Jordan?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yup. I'll never claim the individual books are perfect, and there's some bits that wont age well, but as a series it's great.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-12T04:08:11-08:00","id":1496904,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cauthon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1487407-badass-splat-boasts?p=1496866#post1496866\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yup. I'll never claim the individual books are perfect, and there's some bits that wont age well, but as a series it's great.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sounds cool!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-12T07:00:45-08:00","id":1496908,"title":"","content":"\u201cImmortality? <i>Not</i> what it\u2019s cracked up to be.\u201d<br /> An Arisen of some sort.<br /> <br /> \u201cGod is dead. <i>We</i> are God, now.\u201d<br /> A Seer of the Throne of some sort.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-12T08:53:53-08:00","id":1496911,"title":"","content":"&quot;So that is the truth of your immortality. To undergo a crucible serving a god who doesn't love you, and to forever be denied death to serve that purpose indefinitely. I...am truly sorry for you. May God ha-&quot;- a MM or Long Night hunter, shortly before being obliterated by a long time mummy foe<br /> <br /> &quot;It's a shame our organization hasn't explored theological possibilities for the existence of monsters. Until then, may we be quick and merciless in their execution&quot;-an MM Hunter<br /> <br /> &quot;The flock appears to have brave sheperds. May we see how they hold off the wolves&quot;-Santified priest before planning attack on MM hunters","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-12T18:05:02-08:00","id":1496951,"title":"","content":"\u201cThe gods hate us all.\u201d<br /> An Iltani vampire.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-13T18:02:13-08:00","id":1497045,"title":"","content":"&quot;You do not know the first note of the music that moves me. But I can sing the note that shatters you into dust.&quot; - An Obrimos mage","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-a-acanthus-legacy-of-strategists\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Agathos Kai Sophos</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Acanthus Legacy of strategists (Mind/Time)</span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1360568-the-szary-stra%C5%BCnik-an-obrimos-legacy-of-scholars-of-the-glyphs-of-fate\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Szary Stra\u017cnik</span></span></a><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">, an Obrimos Legacy whose invisible hands guide through the Glyphs of Fate (Fate/Prime)</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24280-kaiserafini","name":"KaiserAfini","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24280_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2648"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-13T19:22:28-08:00","id":1497058,"title":"","content":"Inspired by <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497002-lex-magica-orders-consilia-and-not-behaving-like-seers\">this thread</a>:<br /> <br /> &quot;They've traumatized a few dozen Sleepers? Rookie numbers. Get back to me when they've scarred an entire cuture for generations. The Astral is <i>sitting </i><i>right there</i>, if you're going to be fucked up in the head at least be interesting about it.&quot; A jaded Lictor","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Monkish Asexual.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1490057-cauthon-s-homebrew-hub#post1490057\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a><br /> <br /> Mostly checked out, there's an uncomfortable amount of condescension in the old guard.</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27258-cauthon","name":"Cauthon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27258_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1780"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-13T22:44:17-08:00","id":1497071,"title":"","content":"&quot;Ahh, you an &quot;Arrow&quot; or whatever? You may actually put up a fight&quot;-A banisher (Weapon preferably) to a talon.<br /> <br /> &quot;I will not tolerate your kind anymore. Hubris is all you are, and I intend to humble you&quot;- a banisher (probably idealogical) to a mage<br /> <br /> &quot;As it turns out, having the consequences of killing on gut instinct be thrown in your face can cause a mad case of hysteria. That's why I'm alive, and he's...well, not&quot;- a mastigos/acanthus after deconstructing what a banisher has caused<br /> <br /> &quot;Mercy? Cmon man, I'm breaking new ground here!&quot;- the rapt","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-14T18:23:08-08:00","id":1497144,"title":"","content":"\u201cBe grateful you <i>don\u2019t</i> what is in the deepest ocean. I <i>do</i>. HP Lovecraft is only the <i>beginning</i>.\u201d<br /> A Coldscale Beast changeling.<br /> <br /> \u201cThe ocean holds great secrets. Come with me, Forsaken, and I will show you what I have learned...\u201d<br /> A Fire-Touched werewolf, part of the Lodge of Odacon.<br /> <br /> \u201cMy Hunger is as deep and as uncompromising as the sea. Here, let me show you!\u201d<br /> A Frozen Seas Moment Insatiable.<br /> <br /> \u201cJaws ain\u2019t got nothing on <i>me</i>.\u201d<br /> A Makara Ravager Beast.<br /> <br /> \u201cOne night, perhaps soon, that which sings to me will rise up and devour everything on the land. So mock me now, while you still can!\u201d<br /> A Nereid vampire.<br /> <br /> \u201cI am a direct descendent of gods that shaped the world with every motion, no matter how miniscule. What are you to <i>that</i>?\u201d<br /> An Oceanid Leviathan.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12219,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","user":"Demigod Beast","date":". 11-29-2022, 12:51 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-15T16:59:41-08:00","id":1497237,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#FFA500\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\"><b>&quot;I am the desert storm, motherfuckers! I am the wildfire that eats <i>forests!</i> What are you? <i>Sticks!</i> Toys glued together by The Gentry! You're nothing! You think you can run from <i>me</i>, assholes!? </b></span></span><i><span style=\"color:#FFA500\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16px\">RUN FROM THIS!!</span>&quot;</b></span></span><br /> --An Elemental Changeling unleashing Elemental Fury on a group of Fetch</i><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#9999ff\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\"><b>&quot;Yo! We got a guest! Say hello to my little friend, <span style=\"font-size:16px\"><i>THE JABBERWOCK!</i></span>&quot;</b></span></span><br /> <i>--A Changeling using Discreet Summons to summon something indiscreet</i><br /> <br /> Some lines from a Changeling game I run.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>When the cat's a Stray, the mice will pray...</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25851-thestray7","name":"TheStray7","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25851_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"176"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-19T16:55:42-08:00","id":1497584,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheStray7</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1487407-badass-splat-boasts?p=1497237#post1497237\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"color:#FFA500\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\"><b>&amp;quot;I am the desert storm, motherfuckers! I am the wildfire that eats <i>forests!</i> What are you? <i>Sticks!</i> Toys glued together by The Gentry! You're nothing! You think you can run from <i>me</i>, assholes!? </b></span></span><i><span style=\"color:#FFA500\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\"><b><span style=\"font-size:16px\">RUN FROM THIS!!</span>&amp;quot;</b></span></span><br /> --An Elemental Changeling unleashing Elemental Fury on a group of Fetch</i><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#9999ff\"><span style=\"font-family:comic sans ms\"><b>&amp;quot;Yo! We got a guest! Say hello to my little friend, <span style=\"font-size:16px\"><i>THE JABBERWOCK!</i></span>&amp;quot;</b></span></span><br /> <i>--A Changeling using Discreet Summons to summon something indiscreet</i><br /> <br /> Some lines from a Changeling game I run.</div> </div> </div> </div>Okay, if I was a one of your players, that second line would have probably made me practically yellow-soil myself in panic upon hearing it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/22.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25791-terrorcooper","name":"TerrorCooper","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-19T17:35:53-08:00","id":1497588,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TerrorCooper</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1487407-badass-splat-boasts?p=1497584#post1497584\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Okay, if I was a one of your players, that second line would have probably made me practically yellow-soil myself in panic upon hearing it.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> It was a fine moment of &quot;Wait, they can <i><b>do</b></i> that!?&quot; for sure. Of course, this particular moment was a case of &quot;Summon Bigger Fish, then run like Hell the other way&quot;...sort of like Call The Hunt was in 1e.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>When the cat's a Stray, the mice will pray...</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25851-thestray7","name":"TheStray7","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25851_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"176"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-19T18:08:50-08:00","id":1497592,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheStray7</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1487407-badass-splat-boasts?p=1497588#post1497588\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It was a fine moment of &amp;quot;Wait, they can <i><b>do</b></i> that!?&amp;quot; for sure. Of course, this particular moment was a case of &amp;quot;Summon Bigger Fish, then run like Hell the other way&amp;quot;...sort of like Call The Hunt was in 1e.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u2026I was kinda meaning IRL, but now I\u2019m genuinely curious as to the actual <i>context</i> behind what you\u2019ve said.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/22.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25791-terrorcooper","name":"TerrorCooper","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-11-19T18:22:29-08:00","id":1497595,"title":"","content":"So I'd established that Jabberwocks were a Wyrd 5 hobgoblin previously in-game. For the situation in question, the Wizened who had Discreet Summons wanted to know if they could summon one as a distraction, to give a bunch of Pandorans that could feed on Glamour (long story) something <i>else</i> to gnaw on and/or get crushed by while she ran for the hills. Discreet Summons can only call Hobgoblins with Wyrd 3 or less, so I ruled that the player could call a &quot;young&quot; Jabberwock for the purpose. It worked.<br /> <br /> Edit: The &quot;Wait, what?&quot; reaction was from the other players, who hadn't realized Discreet Summons could be used to summon bestial Hobgoblins like the Jabberwock or other Hedge Beasts just as well as calling up specialist Hobs.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>When the cat's a Stray, the mice will pray...</i>","edited":{"userid":25851,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25851-thestray7","user":"TheStray7","date":". 11-19-2022, 09:33 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25851-thestray7","name":"TheStray7","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25851_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"176"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-03T06:44:25-08:00","id":1498669,"title":"","content":"<b><i><u>WAR IS THE HIGHEST CALLING. BUTCHERY THE GRANDEST BLESSING. MERCY THE GREATEST FAILURE.</u></i></b><br /> The General, an Exarch.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-03T14:28:34-08:00","id":1498703,"title":"","content":"<u><i><b>HOPE IS HUBRIS, WHEN ALL IS DUST.</b></i></u><br /> Ochema of the Ruin, Exarch of Fate","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27115,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27115-glorious-end","user":"Glorious End","date":". 12-03-2022, 05:31 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27115-glorious-end","name":"Glorious End","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-03T18:11:31-08:00","id":1498715,"title":"","content":"<b><span style=\"color:red\">YOU HAVE SINNED. PERISH.</span></b><br /> Any of the Judges of Duat.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-05T23:52:10-07:00","id":1513989,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sin-eater</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;Death can have you when I'm finished and not before.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>I was listening to the OSP video that inspired my Deviant concept, so started thinking of this thread. She's an Amalgam created by a cult, and so in addition to the usual Deviant stuff\u2014and trying to reconstruct her cult that fell to the Web of Pain\u2014she acts as the mortal avatar of her cult's goddess. So this isn't just <i>any</i> Deviant, it's a specific one. See if you can guess who the goddess is!<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Alex &quot;Alecto&quot; Tacoma, speaking for her Amalgam</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">No more! Do you know who I am?<br /> I was born from the castration of <b>the Sky</b>! I was The Fairest, who tempted Paris with beauty, who won the Apple, who drove the Achaeans to war as I laughed. I am mother of mania and passion! My blessing brought happy fortune to Hippomenes and Pygmalion. My spite killed Hippolytus, Glaucus, drove the women of Thrace to tear Orpheus apart. As Nemesis I drove Narcissus to waste into a flower. <b>You</b> have earned my <b>wrath</b>.<br /> I am neither Urania or Pandaemos.<br /> <span style=\"color:red\"><b>I am Areia</b></span>!</div> </div> </div> </div>Note, of course, she has not personally done any of those things. But the fragment of a god in her chest has! Maybe.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my first Storyteller's Vault product: <a href=\"http://www.storytellersvault.com/product/438661/Pretty-Guardian-Faerie-Knights-A-Hunter-the-Vigil-Conspiracy\" target=\"_blank\">Pretty Guardian Faerie Knights</a><br /> Currently working on <b>Night Horrors: Pushing Daisies</b>. <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/1517001-%F0%9F%91%BB-a-handful-of-sample-geists\" target=\"_blank\">Sample here</a>.","edited":{"userid":2998,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2998-aspel","user":"Aspel","date":". 06-06-2023, 02:38 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2998-aspel","name":"Aspel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2998_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"403"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-07T04:13:50-07:00","id":1514104,"title":"","content":"&quot;You have no future.&quot; - Acanthus Mage with high Time Arcanum.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11880-dark-archon","name":"Dark Archon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11880_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"348"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-07T14:39:04-07:00","id":1514133,"title":"","content":"My people killed the God of the Border Marshes and reshaped multiple worlds, what has your people ever accomplished?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27618-shadowcatx","name":"ShadowcatX","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27618_2.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-08T10:25:19-07:00","id":1514202,"title":"","content":"Looking at Princess for whatever reason and looking up several of the stereotypes my brain just can't help but think of comebacks specifically with mummy<br /> <br /> Mummies: Our kingdoms have both fallen, but I\u2019m trying to rebuild mine.<br /> &quot;Why would I need to rebuild Irem when it's all around us.&quot;<br /> <br /> Mummies: I can think of no curse greater than an unchanging immortality.<br /> &quot;What you call unchanging I call enduring immortality, and let me assure you enduring does not mean unchanging.&quot;<br /> <br /> Mummies: I\u2019m only sort of immortal, but at least I\u2019m alive.<br /> &quot;Child I have lived a thousand lifetimes and have done and change more lives than you and your little group can ever do, I am more alive and more real than you ever will be.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":893,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/893-reaperfrost8","user":"reaperfrost8","date":". 06-08-2023, 01:30 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/893-reaperfrost8","name":"reaperfrost8","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar893_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-08T11:53:02-07:00","id":1514216,"title":"","content":"&quot;Don't move. It's your turn to be guinea pigs&quot;-a deviant to his former captors<br /> <br /> &quot;War is hell. But for me, it was Tuesday&quot;- a Praetorian seer","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-08T12:21:57-07:00","id":1514223,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>reaperfrost8</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1487407-badass-splat-boasts?p=1514202#post1514202\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Looking at Princess for whatever reason and looking up several of the stereotypes my brain just can't help but think of comebacks specifically with mummy<br /> <br /> Mummies: Our kingdoms have both fallen, but I\u2019m trying to rebuild mine.<br /> &quot;Why would I need to rebuild Irem when it's all around us.&quot;<br /> <br /> Mummies: I can think of no curse greater than an unchanging immortality.<br /> &quot;What you call unchanging I call enduring immortality, and let me assure you enduring does not mean unchanging.&quot;<br /> <br /> Mummies: I\u2019m only sort of immortal, but at least I\u2019m alive.<br /> &quot;Child I have lived a thousand lifetimes and have done and change more lives than you and your little group can ever do, I am more alive and more real than you ever will be.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div><i>&quot;A thousand lifetimes lived, a tapestry riddled with your defeats, yet the one victory which matters remains beyond your reach.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;To name the dirt at our feet 'Irem' is to name an anthill Rome, or a slum Babylon, but let me reap a grain of truth from your claim: it is the image of <b>my </b>kingdom - <b>my </b>empire - this world tries and fails to mock with blood and sacrifice, not yours. My empire's death is mourned by those who've never known its name. And lest you forget, Princess, Irem never suffered the taste of its own defeat.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;You call your immortality 'enduring', but those Born of Gold would know it better as 'deformation' and 'erosion'.&quot;</i>\u200b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23800-the-firebrand","name":"The Firebrand","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23800_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"46"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-09T05:12:07-07:00","id":1514297,"title":"","content":"Okay, here's my renditions of a couple of absolutely CHAD Boasts that were posted on the P:tH Discord Channel by someone going by the handle of 'Goa';<br /> <br /> /\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\<br /> <br /> 1. &quot;You're right you know. I'm fat as a pig, as clumsy as a klutz can get &amp; fiction was the only teacher I had on swordsmanship. My knees are knocking as hard as they can, I'm about ready to yellow-soil myself, and yet... here I am.<br /> <br /> &quot;&amp; doesn't that <i>scare</i> you? 'Cause if <b>I</b>'m willing to stand up to a bastard such as you, then who else do you think will?&quot;<br /> <br /> /\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/\\<br /> <br /> 2. &quot;I've a rod solid steel shoved through my sternum, yet I'm still standing on my own two feet &amp; holding ground.<br /> <br /> &quot;Now... Who amongst your number has it within them to challenge me?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/22.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25791-terrorcooper","name":"TerrorCooper","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-10T01:48:00-07:00","id":1514426,"title":"","content":"If I say something is true then it\u2019s true! Reality will just have to keep up!<br /> <br /> Elder Mage going off the deep end<br /> <br /> I learned to face my fears when I became a Mage. If they couldn\u2019t stop me then what makes you think you can use them against me now?<br /> <br /> Mastigos Mage to a Beast","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1685-looker","name":"Looker","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"28"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-12T01:35:49-07:00","id":1514665,"title":"","content":"[deleted post]","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/22.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":25791,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25791-terrorcooper","user":"TerrorCooper","date":".  OG Post got approved. 06-19-2023, 06:22 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25791-terrorcooper","name":"TerrorCooper","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"325"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-18T16:26:37-07:00","id":1515498,"title":"","content":"You will feel the power of True Zeal, Fanatic! -Noble of Crosses to a Fire Touched Pure<br /> <br /> Have all that you know fed to this realm of death- An Kerberoi to an Arch mage<br /> <br /> You claim to be taught your magics form the dragons of old, and yet you missed part of the lesson on Pride. - A Dragon(Embers) ready to Curb a mage<br /> <br /> We have your powers and Ways studied reality bender and we have found it unimpressive and shoddy - Alien to a Mage<br /> <br /> For someone already seemly lacking a soul you sure are scared of letting it go - A siren to some CEO<br /> <br /> FUCK PARADOX -Either a Mage or COFD fan","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27385,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27385-cross-a-way","user":"Cross-a-way","date":". 06-28-2023, 09:02 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27385-cross-a-way","name":"Cross-a-way","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27385_1.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"106"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-09-24T06:47:38-07:00","id":1542548,"title":"","content":"&quot;In Arcadia, I was just another player. Here, I\u2019m the one writing the code.&quot;<br /> - Darkling from the BriarNet.<br /> <br /> &quot;Survival isn\u2019t just a skill; it\u2019s an art. And I\u2019ve mastered it in every dimension.&quot;<br /> - Changeling Helldiver<br /> <br /> &quot;Died a hundred deaths and came back stronger each time. What\u2019s one more challenge?&quot;<br /> - A Sin-Eater","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Homebrews:</span></b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1492909-horodrigo-homebrews-2ed\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#B22222\"><b>Vampire Homebrews</b></span></a><br /> <span style=\"color:#0000CD\"><b>Mage Legacies:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1074696-2ed-legacy-experiment-infernal-ones\" target=\"_blank\">Infernal Ones</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1070254-2e-legacies-conversions-and-homebrew?p=1078103#post1078103\" target=\"_blank\">Daoine</a>, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1536102-homebrew-legacy-the-changed\" target=\"_blank\">Changed</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7210-horodrigo","name":"Horodrigo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7210_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"370"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-09-24T07:52:45-07:00","id":1542549,"title":"","content":"&quot;Good cousin... there's a lot more to fear than simply death alone. Let me show you.&quot;<br /> -Begotten to Sin-Eater<br /> <br /> &quot;From where I'm sitting, it looks like you all are struggling to grasp at what I was never dumb enough to give up.&quot;<br /> -Mortal to Vampire<br /> <br /> &quot;Pfft. Why bother making bargains or tribute when I can just skin them and get what I want?&quot;<br /> -Skinthief to Werewolves<br /> <br /> &quot;...This is what passes for 'Elder' around here?&quot;<br /> -Mummy to Older Vampires<br /> <br /> &quot;This is what passes for 'Demon' around here?!&quot;<br /> -Lucifuge to Unchained Demon<br /> <br /> &quot;Yeah... yeah.. yeah. Keep bragging about how you're totally a witch or whatever. Cast a spell right now to prove it - I dare you.&quot;<br /> -Sleeper to Mage","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28571-seven-ate-nine","name":"Seven.Ate.Nine","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-09-24T15:42:14-07:00","id":1542587,"title":"","content":"&quot;No...&quot;-a ghoul, finally breaking away from the Vinculum<br /> <br /> &quot;you cant hide in plain sight forever! Mark my words! Even if must die to prove it, I WILL reveal your evil nature&quot;-a hunter (tier one, possible network 0 recruit) exclaiming to a cocky vampire/demon<br /> <br /> &quot;Oh, that's easy...you are&quot;- a player in my hunter campaign when a vampire did the &quot;who's the real monster&quot; speech, before getting torched","signature":"","edited":{"userid":24173,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","user":"Primordial newcomer","date":". 09-24-2024, 06:47 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24173-primordial-newcomer","name":"Primordial newcomer","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1965"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-09-29T23:56:29-07:00","id":1542896,"title":"","content":"&quot;Be thankful I won't remember you later.&quot; - Mummy<br /> <br /> &quot;I don't need connections, <i><b>I</b></i> <b><i>am </i></b> connections.&quot; Any of the Unchained who make a hobby of being a fixer. <br /> <br /> &quot;Yeah I can make a Geneva Convention violation out of some sparklers and a bubble wand.&quot;- Genius or someone from the Sons of Aether I'd say.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}